{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Anura",
    "steam_appid": 3674240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/4453a34ad181b569d726d346782ba51d.avif?t=1755015957\" width=650 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cAnura\u201d you are Don Rano, a frog with the mission to cross the swamp\u00a0 jumping from platform to platform, dodging obstacles and using bubbles to propel himself as far as possible. Thanks to his bubble-blower, you will be able to create bubbles that will help you get to places you didn't think you would be able to reach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use bubbles to jump</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if some platforms seem far away, you can use the bubbles on the stage to jump on them and propel yourself further. But be careful! The bubbles are fragile, and will break as soon as you touch them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/0952bcb6dc30e5b4bfc692a5df974cf1.poster.avif?t=1755015957\" width=616 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/0952bcb6dc30e5b4bfc692a5df974cf1.webm?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/0952bcb6dc30e5b4bfc692a5df974cf1.mp4?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own bubbles </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it may seem impossible to get to the other side, but don't worry, because Don Rano always carries his bubble-blower on his back, so blow up and create the bubbles you need to reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/467ac40d145d332296567255cd4a5c01.poster.avif?t=1755015957\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/467ac40d145d332296567255cd4a5c01.webm?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/467ac40d145d332296567255cd4a5c01.mp4?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore all levels and set your new high score!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't only matter how fast you get to the end, it also matters how fast you can do it! Explore all the levels and try to beat yourself with each new attempt. Will you be the fastest frog in the whole swamp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/009df83fd61ce6785e80119a5141cf15.avif?t=1755015957\" width=800 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you be able to get by using Don Rano's powers? Will you be able to reach the end of his adventure and find out why he had to travel through the swamp? And most importantly, will you be the fastest to do it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/4453a34ad181b569d726d346782ba51d.avif?t=1755015957\" width=650 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cAnura\u201d you are Don Rano, a frog with the mission to cross the swamp\u00a0 jumping from platform to platform, dodging obstacles and using bubbles to propel himself as far as possible. Thanks to his bubble-blower, you will be able to create bubbles that will help you get to places you didn't think you would be able to reach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use bubbles to jump</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if some platforms seem far away, you can use the bubbles on the stage to jump on them and propel yourself further. But be careful! The bubbles are fragile, and will break as soon as you touch them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/0952bcb6dc30e5b4bfc692a5df974cf1.poster.avif?t=1755015957\" width=616 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/0952bcb6dc30e5b4bfc692a5df974cf1.webm?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/0952bcb6dc30e5b4bfc692a5df974cf1.mp4?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own bubbles </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it may seem impossible to get to the other side, but don't worry, because Don Rano always carries his bubble-blower on his back, so blow up and create the bubbles you need to reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/467ac40d145d332296567255cd4a5c01.poster.avif?t=1755015957\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/467ac40d145d332296567255cd4a5c01.webm?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/467ac40d145d332296567255cd4a5c01.mp4?t=1755015957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore all levels and set your new high score!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't only matter how fast you get to the end, it also matters how fast you can do it! Explore all the levels and try to beat yourself with each new attempt. Will you be the fastest frog in the whole swamp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674240/extras/009df83fd61ce6785e80119a5141cf15.avif?t=1755015957\" width=800 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you be able to get by using Don Rano's powers? Will you be able to reach the end of his adventure and find out why he had to travel through the swamp? And most importantly, will you be the fastest to do it?</p>",
    "short_description": "Join Don Rano in his adventure! A platformer in which you will have to use the bubbles of the stage, and the ones you create, in order to reach the most difficult platforms. Will you try to go as fast as possible? Or will you take it at your own pace? You decide!",
